          "text": "Reported left eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Persistent gritty/scratchy sensation, especially on blinking; mild photophobia, watering, and mild redness. Vision was a bit blurry yesterday but feels okay now. No purulent discharge or crusting, diplopia, or visual field loss."
      }
    },
